WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.940 --> 00:00:07.300
Our Environment – Tō Tātou Taiao

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:14.540
The Waimakariri District is home to a beautiful and diverse natural environment

00:00:14.540 --> 00:00:17.160
that stretches from the mountains to the sea.

00:00:19.860 --> 00:00:25.440
We have protected forested areas, wetlands,
tussock and grasslands.

00:00:25.450 --> 00:00:30.510
We have many waterways in which we are working
with Ngai Tuahuriri and Environment Canterbury

00:00:30.510 --> 00:00:32.740
to improve the quality of the water.

00:00:33.280 --> 00:00:37.640
We also have areas, especially in the east,
that are susceptible to natural hazards

00:00:37.640 --> 00:00:39.280
such as flooding.

00:00:39.720 --> 00:00:43.920
Our District - Our Future, Waimakariri 2048
aims to:

00:01:17.320 --> 00:01:18.560
So what do you think?

00:01:19.380 --> 00:01:23.960
Let us know your thoughts and find out more
about the District Development Strategy at

00:01:23.960 --> 00:01:27.220
waimakariri.govt.nz

